  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step-001",
      "title": "构造并断言：依次挂起十一条真实请求，证明超过旧上限后的每次命中仍保持等待。 / Arrange and assert: enqueue eleven real requests, proving every hit beyond the former limit remains pending.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-001.png",
      "rawImage": "step-001.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-002",
      "title": "清理：由真实客户端断开释放十一条等待项，再开始后续逐项推进场景。 / Cleanup: real client disconnects release all eleven items before the stepping scenario starts.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-002.png",
      "rawImage": "step-002.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-003",
      "title": "构造：按确定顺序挂起A、B、C，并验证公开的队列位置。 / Arrange: enqueue A, B, C in a deterministic order and prove their public queue positions.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-003.png",
      "rawImage": "step-003.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-004",
      "title": "原样放行当前HTTP队首 / Continue the current HTTP head without edits",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-004.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-004.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2781.546875,
            "y": 1653,
            "width": 136.53125,
            "height": 60
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.continue-unmodified"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-005",
      "title": "操作：中止中间客户端，再继续A；选择必须根据最新快照推进到C。 / Act: abort the middle client, then continue A and require selection to advance to C from the latest snapshot.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-005.png",
      "rawImage": "step-005.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-006",
      "title": "操作：加入D并查看普通流量，再中止C；D成为队首但不得夺取Capture焦点。 / Act: queue D, view ordinary traffic, then abort C; D becomes head without taking Capture focus.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-006.png",
      "rawImage": "step-006.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-007",
      "title": "断言与清理：显式选择D后才出现编辑器；已中止请求绝不抵达origin。 / Assert and cleanup: D only becomes editable after explicit selection; aborted requests never reach origin.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-007.png",
      "rawImage": "step-007.png"
    }
  ],
